# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Contact form — every enquiry is emailed using Gmail + an App Password.
#
# 1. Turn on 2-Step Verification for the Gmail account.
# 2. Create an App Password: Google Account → Security → App passwords.
# 3. Copy this file to ".env.local" (for your computer) and fill it in.
# 4. Add the same values in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
# Never commit .env.local — it is already in .gitignore.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
SMTP_USER=your-gmail-address@gmail.com
SMTP_PASS=your-16-character-app-password
CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=where-enquiries-should-arrive@example.com

# Optional (defaults shown)
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=465
